  "topic_id": "t-mm-09-002",
  "book_id": "book-mm-09",
  "title": "1.1.\tGBS IN PREGNANCY:",
  "source_sha256": "f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605",
  "block_count": 1,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-09-002\" hidden></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15685]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>1.1.</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>GBS IN PREGNANCY:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15686]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>in UK 0.5/100.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15687]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>anten</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>atal </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>screening </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>is</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> done @</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>35 \u2013 37 in singleton, 32 \u2013 34 </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>in </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>twins.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15688]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Incidence of GBS carriage = 20-40% of bowel flora. </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15689]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Incidence of GBS:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15690]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Overall = 0.57/1000.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15691]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Without risk factor = 0.2/ 1000.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15692]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>In previous pregnancy = 0.9/ 1000.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15693]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>If GBS in current pregnancy = 2.3/ 1000.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15694]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pyrexia &gt; 38 = 5.3/ 1000.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15695]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>EONNS:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15696]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Early onset Neonatal sepsis &lt; 7 days </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15697]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>89% within 24hours.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15698]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>97% within 12 hours.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15699]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Mortality of EONNS = 10.6% overall</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15700]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>&gt;37 weeks = 5.7%</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15701]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>&lt;37 weeks = 18.3%</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15702]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>&lt;35 weeks = 22%</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15703]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Late:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15704]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>7 and above days.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15705]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>17 \u2013 25% screen positive @ 35 \u2013 37 weeks will be negative @ delivery.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15706]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>5 \u2013 7% screen negative will be </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>positive </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>@ birth.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15707]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>No screening on maternal request.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15708]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>GBS carriage PROM =&gt; </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>cat</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>egory</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> 2/3 C/S </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>if required</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15709]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Antenatal A</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>ntibiotics</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15710]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>GBS bacteriuria (Antenatal + IAP).</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15711]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Membrane sweeping is not C/I.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15712]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Commonest Cause GBS:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15713]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>streptococcus agalactiae.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15714]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>E \u2013 Coli.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15715]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Meningitis = 11.8%.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15716]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pneumonia = 7.8%.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15717]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Focal infection = 1%.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15718]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Risk Factor for GBS:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15719]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Previous baby GBS.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15720]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>GBS carriage.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15721]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pre \u2013 term.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15722]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Prolong rupture of membranes &gt; 18 hours.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15723]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Suspected maternal infection.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15724]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pyrexia </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u>&gt;</u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> 38</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>C.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15725]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Indications of GBS IAP (80% Effective):</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15726]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Previous baby with invasive GBS.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15727]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>GBS </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>bacteriuria</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> 10</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>5</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>cfu/ml in current pregnancy.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15728]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>GBS on vaginal sw</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>a</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>b in current pregnancy.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15729]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pyrexia &gt; 38</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>F (Broad spectrum A/B).</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15730]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Chorioamni</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>oniti</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>s</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> (Broad Spectrum A/B) @ PTL.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15731]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>GBS carriage in previous pregnancy either IAP or screening @ 35 \u2013 37 weeks.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15732]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Repeat colonization = 50%.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15733]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Repeat GBS = 0.9/ 1000.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15734]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15735]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15736]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15737]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15738]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15739]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15740]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15741]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15742]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'><strong> intrapartum antibiotic prophylaxis (IAP)</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15743]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>Benzyl penicillin 3g stat </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>followed by </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>1.5g 4</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>hourly</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'> till delivery</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15744]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>clinda</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>mycin</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'> 900g stat </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>then</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'> 8 hourly</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'> till delivery (</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>resistance = 16%</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>)</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15745]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>Vanc</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>o</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>mycin</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'> 1g \u2013 12 hourly, if severe </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>allergy</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'> to Benzyl Penicillin </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>(</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>Angioedema, </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>urticaria</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'> anaphylaxis, RDS</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>)</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15746]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Cefuroxim</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>e 1</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.5</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>g stat </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>then</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> 750g \u2013 8 h</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ourly if mild allergy to Benzyl</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> Penicillin</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15747]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pt refuses IAP =&gt; Observe baby for 12 hours.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15748]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Avoid \u2013 Ampicillin =&gt; G \u2013 negative sepsis.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15749]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Urgent Help if bab</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>y:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15750]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Inconsolable</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> c</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>r</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>y, listlessness.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15751]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Floppy, </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>diffic</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>u</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>l</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>t feeding.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15752]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Abnormal temperature.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[15753]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>&gt; 38</span><span class=\